ort photos?","Segundo, organizar fotos?"],["Leo","Yes. Third, back up what remains.","Sim. Terceiro, fazer backup do que sobra."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","items":[{"label":"Contrações e fala conectada (compreensão)","note":"Reconheça: I’ve → /aɪv/, she’s → /ʃiz/, wouldn’t’ve, whaddaya (what do you), gonna, wanna.","words":["I’ve been there.","She’s been studying.","What do you want?","I’d’ve gone."]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Name steps with ordinals.","pt":"Diga.","model":"First, delete files. Second, back up."},{"q":"Ask for a repeat.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Could you repeat that, please?"},{"q":"Use get rid of.","pt":"Use.","model":"I got rid of old files."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write notes for a 3-step lecture.","model":"Topic: digital clutter. Step 1: get rid of unused apps. Step 2: sort photos into folders. Step 3: back up what remains. Quiz at the end.","checklist":["Anotei **passos**","Usei **palavras-chave**","Notas curtas"],"words":"5 notas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “digital clutter” mean?","opts":["aplicativo sem uso","backup de arquivos","bagunça digital"],"ans":2,"why":"**digital clutter** = bagunça digital."},{"q":"What does “unused app” mean?","opts":["aplicativo sem uso","pasta de fotos","espaço de armazenamento"],"ans":0,"why":"**unused app** = aplicativo sem uso."},{"q":"What does “photo folder” mean?","opts":["backup de arquivos","pasta de fotos","computador lento"],"ans":1,"why":"**photo folder** = pasta de fotos."},{"q":"What does “file backup” mean?","opts":["espaço de armazenamento","ícone da área de trabalho","backup de arquivos"],"ans":2,"why":"**file backup** = backup de arquivos."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as pro